WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.869 --> 00:00:07.369
In this video you'll read a private message, reply to it, and start a conversation with another teacher.

2
00:00:07.871 --> 00:00:17.061
Direct messages are private between you and one other member. Your conversations are listed on the left, and a number shows how many messages you haven't read.

3
00:00:17.563 --> 00:00:20.023
Select a conversation to open it.

4
00:00:20.525 --> 00:00:24.205
Type your reply, then press Enter or select Send.

5
00:00:25.981 --> 00:00:32.761
To message someone new, look in the Members list on the right. Type at least two letters of a name to search.

6
00:00:33.263 --> 00:00:36.193
Select a member to start a conversation with them.

7
00:00:36.693 --> 00:00:43.363
Write your message and send it. The next time Priya opens the community, she'll see a number beside your name.

8
00:00:43.865 --> 00:00:49.815
You can also select View Profile above a conversation to see more about the person you're talking to.

9
00:00:50.316 --> 00:00:55.326
Your conversations stay in the list, so you can pick one back up whenever you like.
